  <wpt lat="40.77935191408153" lon="76.38122867715941">
    <name>The Old Soviet Road</name>
    <cmt>caution</cmt>
    <desc>This section of the route used to be a military access road in a zone that was much more tightly controlled in soviet times because of the proximity with China. Much of this section of road follows old barbed wire fences. There is still barbed wire strewn on the floor in places. </desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>danger</type>
  </wpt>
